---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HomeBackLink from './HomeBackLink.astro';
interface Props { kind: 'clarin' | 'baltic'; lang: 'lv' | 'en'; }
const { kind, lang } = Astro.props;
const lv = lang === 'lv';
const clarin = kind === 'clarin';
const title = clarin ? (lv ? 'CLARIN–DARIAH pavasara konference' : 'CLARIN–DARIAH Spring Conference') : 'Baltic DH Forum';
const alternateUrl = clarin ? (lv ? '/en/events/clarin-dariah-spring-conference-2026/' : '/lv/pasakumi/clarin-dariah-pavasara-konference-2026/') : (lv ? '/en/events/baltic-dh-forum-2024/' : '/lv/pasakumi/baltijas-dh-forums-2024/');
const tabs = clarin ? (lv ? [['Par konferenci','#par-konferenci'],['Programma','#programma'],['Norises vieta','#vieta'],['Organizatori','#organizatori']] : [['About','#about'],['Programme','#programme'],['Venue','#venue'],['Organisers','#organisers']]) : [['Overview','#overview'],['Programme','#programme'],['Practical info','#practical'],['Recordings & photos','#materials']];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={title} lang={lang} alternateUrl={alternateUrl}>
  <article class={`event-microsite ${kind}`}>
    <div class="shell"><HomeBackLink lang={lang} /></div>
    <header class="event-hero shell">
      <p class="event-kicker">{clarin ? 'CLARIN × DARIAH' : 'BALTIC DIGITAL HUMANITIES'}</p>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <div class="event-facts"><span>{clarin ? (lv ? '5.–6. marts 2026' : '5–6 March 2026') : '25–26 April 2024'}</span><span>{clarin ? (lv ? 'Rīga, Latvijas Universitāte' : 'Riga, University of Latvia') : 'House of Science, University of Latvia · Riga'}</span></div>
    </header>
    <nav class="event-index shell" aria-label={lv ? 'Lapas saturs' : 'Page contents'}>{tabs.map(([label,href]) => <a href={href}>{label}<span>↓</span></a>)}</nav>
    {clarin ? <div class="shell event-sections">
      <section id={lv ? 'par-konferenci' : 'about'}><h2>{lv ? 'Par konferenci' : 'About the conference'}</h2><div><p>{lv ? 'CLARIN–DARIAH pavasara konference pulcēja Latvijas un ārvalstu digitālo humanitāro zinātņu pētniekus un infrastruktūru pārstāvjus, lai apspriestu valodu resursus, mākslīgā intelekta laikmeta pētniecības vidi un DARIAH-LV attīstību.' : 'The CLARIN–DARIAH Spring Conference brought together Latvian and international digital humanities researchers and research-infrastructure representatives to discuss language resources, research in the age of AI and the development of DARIAH-LV.'}</p><p>{lv ? 'Konference notika divās dienās: pirmā diena bija veltīta CLARIN un DARIAH pieredzei, demonstrācijām un pētniecības infrastruktūrām; otrajā dienā uzmanības centrā bija sadarbība, kompetences un DARIAH-LV veidošana.' : 'The two-day programme combined CLARIN and DARIAH presentations, demonstrations and discussion of research infrastructures, collaboration and capacity building.'}</p></div></section>
      <section id={lv ? 'programma' : 'programme'}><h2>{lv ? 'Programma' : 'Programme'}</h2><div class="programme-days"><div><h3>{lv ? '5. marts' : '5 March'}</h3><p><b>11.00</b> {lv ? 'Atklāšana' : 'Opening'}</p><p><b>11.15</b> Andrius Utka — <i>CLARIN-LT: Lithuanian Language Resources for the Age of AI</i></p><p><b>12.00</b> Ahmad Kamal — <i>DARIAH-SE: Perspectives from DARIAH’s Swedish Node</i></p><p><b>12.30</b> Inguna Skadiņa — {lv ? '10 gadi ar CLARIN: sapņi un īstenība' : 'Ten years with CLARIN'}</p><p><b>12.45</b> Sanita Reinsone — {lv ? 'Ceļā uz DARIAH-LV' : 'Towards DARIAH-LV'}</p><p><b>13.00</b> {lv ? 'Demonstrācijas, diskusijas un tīklošanās' : 'Demonstrations, discussion and networking'}</p></div><div><h3>{lv ? '6. marts' : '6 March'}</h3><p>{lv ? 'DARIAH-LV sadarbības, kompetenču un pārvaldības darba sesijas.' : 'Working sessions on DARIAH-LV collaboration, competencies and governance.'}</p><p>{lv ? 'Institūciju un pētniecības kopienas diskusija par nacionālās infrastruktūras turpmāko attīstību.' : 'Discussion among institutions and research communities on the further development of the national infrastructure.'}</p></div></div></section>
      <section id={lv ? 'vieta' : 'venue'}><h2>{lv ? 'Norises vieta' : 'Venue'}</h2><div><p>{lv ? 'Latvijas Universitāte, Rīga. Konference ir noslēgusies; lapa saglabāta kā programmas un pasākuma materiālu arhīvs.' : 'University of Latvia, Riga. The conference has concluded; this page is preserved as an archive of its programme and materials.'}</p></div></section>
      <section id={lv ? 'organizatori' : 'organisers'}><h2>{lv ? 'Organizatori' : 'Organisers'}</h2><div><p>CLARIN-LV · DARIAH-LV · {lv ? 'Latvijas Universitāte · LU Matemātikas un informātikas institūts · LU Literatūras, folkloras un mākslas institūts' : 'University of Latvia · Institute of Mathematics and Computer Science · Institute of Literature, Folklore and Art'}</p></div></section>
    </div> : <div class="shell event-sections">
      <section id="overview"><h2>Overview</h2><div><p>Digital humanities have become a solid part of the research landscapes in the Baltic countries. The Baltic DH Forum brought the communities of Estonia, Latvia and Lithuania together to reflect on the development of the field and to shape future collaboration.</p><p>The first day comprised invited talks from Baltic research communities, ministries and European research infrastructures, including CLARIN ERIC and DARIAH-EU. The second day provided a platform for projects, digital resources, tools and educational initiatives.</p><div class="event-actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://baltic-dh.spread.name">Poster explorer ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://photos.google.com/share/AF1QipP9PgEQc2GnnJRpPN48o9D1Fm237pqd0WEed0TUgpI7HwLUkUjfbeWsbIwKl6_x8g?key=Ums4NHNaX0gtSWQzMzdxMnE4WnlFS3N5ajlBem5R">Photo archive ↗</a></div></div></section>
      <section id="programme"><h2>Programme</h2><div class="programme-days"><div><h3>25 April · Conference day</h3><p>Opening and three thematic panels with speakers from the Baltic DH communities, public institutions, CLARIN ERIC and DARIAH-EU.</p><p>DARIAH workshop and panel discussions were followed by a reception and networking.</p></div><div><h3>26 April · Demonstration and networking</h3><p>Pitch presentations and a poster hall featuring 55 projects, resources, tools and educational initiatives from the Baltic countries and beyond.</p><p>A workshop on language technologies in higher education accompanied the demonstration programme.</p></div></div></section>
      <section id="practical"><h2>Practical information</h2><div><h3>House of Science, University of Latvia</h3><p><b>Address:</b> Jelgavas Street 3, Riga</p><p>Trams 1, 2, 5 and 10 or buses stopping at “Nacionālā bibliotēka”, followed by a ten-minute walk. Bus 23 stops at “Latvijas Universitātes Akadēmiskais centrs”.</p></div></section>
      <section id="materials"><h2>Recordings & photos</h2><div><div class="event-media"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/p8e1_5LsNJw" title="Baltic DH Forum panels 1 and 2" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><p>Recording of Panels 1 and 2, 25 April 2024.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://photos.google.com/share/AF1QipP9PgEQc2GnnJRpPN48o9D1Fm237pqd0WEed0TUgpI7HwLUkUjfbeWsbIwKl6_x8g?key=Ums4NHNaX0gtSWQzMzdxMnE4WnlFS3N5ajlBem5R">Open the complete photo archive ↗</a></div></section>
    </div>}
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
